(15,'FDA CDRH 510(k) Clearance (K260132): Jason membrane by Botiss Biomaterials GmbH','fda-510k-k260132-jason-membrane-87c710','FDA issues 510(k) premarket notification clearance for Jason membrane (K260132) manufactured by Botiss Biomaterials GmbH.','\n      <p>The FDA Center for Devices and Radiological Health (CDRH) has finalized premarket notification review under Section 510(k) for <strong>Jason membrane</strong>.</p>\n      <h2>Premarket Clearance Dossier</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Submission Number:</strong> K260132</li>\n        <li><strong>Applicant / Sponsor:</strong> Botiss Biomaterials GmbH</li>\n        <li><strong>Device Trade Name:</strong> Jason membrane</li>\n        <li><strong>Product Code:</strong> NPL</li>\n        <li><strong>Advisory Committee:</strong> Dental</li>\n        <li><strong>Regulatory Decision:</strong> Substantially Equivalent</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>The FDA determined that the device is substantially equivalent to legally marketed predicate devices for the indications specified in the submission summary.</p>\n    ','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579684385127-1ef15d508118?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80','Medical device engineering and FDA 510(k) clearance documentation.','Published',1,NULL,12,2,'https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpmn/pmn.cfm?ID=K260132','b5ac9f017f26c5b4ca57ffa56de568eaae4a65f189cb4d4da1efb75382fface4','K260132','https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpmn/pmn.cfm?ID=K260132','FDA CDRH 510(k) Clearance (K260132): Jason membrane by Botis | NewsKrez','FDA issues 510(k) premarket notification clearance for Jason membrane (K260132) manufactured by Botiss Biomaterials GmbH.',0,0,0,49,3,'2026-11-07 18:30:00',NULL,'2026-11-18 02:04:58','2026-11-18 02:04:58','newskrez',NULL,NULL,'en','2026-11-18 08:34:41'),
