(30,'FDA Grants Premarket Approval (PMA P960009): Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000) by Medtronic, Inc.','fda-pma-p960009-activa-deep-brain-stimulation-therapy-system-percept-pc-brainsen-64bf5b','FDA awards Class III Premarket Approval (PMA P960009) for Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000) sponsored by Medtronic, Inc..','\n      <p>The FDA Center for Devices and Radiological Health has granted Premarket Approval (PMA) for <strong>Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000)</strong>, classified as a Class III life-supporting or life-sustaining medical device.</p>\n      <h2>PMA Approval Dossier</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>PMA Number:</strong> P960009</li>\n        <li><strong>Applicant:</strong> Medtronic, Inc.</li>\n        <li><strong>Device Designation:</strong> Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000)</li>\n        <li><strong>Product Code:</strong> MHY</li>\n        <li><strong>Decision Code:</strong> APPR</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Approval was based on rigorous review of valid scientific evidence, including bench testing, animal studies, and human clinical trial outcomes establishing a reasonable assurance of safety and effectiveness.</p>\n    ','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584515979956-d9f6e5d09982?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80','Class III medical device technology receiving FDA premarket approval.','Published',1,NULL,12,4,'https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpma/pma.cfm?id=P960009','8e0baee43462f52f23f1c170ad0963c4b1af40401cf9f62e6f615a655d2218a1','P960009','https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpma/pma.cfm?id=P960009','FDA Grants Premarket Approval (PMA P960009): Activa Deep Br | NewsKrez','FDA awards Class III Premarket Approval (PMA P960009) for Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000) sponsored by Medtronic',0,0,0,49,3,'2026-11-07 18:30:00',NULL,'2026-11-18 02:04:59','2026-11-18 02:04:59','newskrez',NULL,NULL,'en','2026-11-18 08:34:41'),
