(34,'FDA Grants Premarket Approval (PMA P050017): Zilver 635 Vascular Stent, Zilver 518 Vascular Stent by Cook Ireland, Ltd.','fda-pma-p050017-zilver-635-vascular-stent-zilver-518-vascular-stent-c75e65','FDA awards Class III Premarket Approval (PMA P050017) for Zilver 635 Vascular Stent, Zilver 518 Vascular Stent sponsored by Cook Ireland, Ltd..','\n      <p>The FDA Center for Devices and Radiological Health has granted Premarket Approval (PMA) for <strong>Zilver 635 Vascular Stent, Zilver 518 Vascular Stent</strong>, classified as a Class III life-supporting or life-sustaining medical device.</p>\n      <h2>PMA Approval Dossier</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>PMA Number:</strong> P050017</li>\n        <li><strong>Applicant:</strong> Cook Ireland, Ltd.</li>\n        <li><strong>Device Designation:</strong> Zilver 635 Vascular Stent, Zilver 518 Vascular Stent</li>\n        <li><strong>Product Code:</strong> NIO</li>\n        <li><strong>Decision Code:</strong> OK30</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Approval was based on rigorous review of valid scientific evidence, including bench testing, animal studies, and human clinical trial outcomes establishing a reasonable assurance of safety and effectiveness.</p>\n    ','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584515979956-d9f6e5d09982?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80','Class III medical device technology receiving FDA premarket approval.','Published',1,NULL,12,4,'https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpma/pma.cfm?id=P050017','3b2ef4f4369269cfee0d24267dabb1e37639b6f779d2e1d5f831d92702586575','P050017','https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpma/pma.cfm?id=P050017','FDA Grants Premarket Approval (PMA P050017): Zilver 635 Vasc | NewsKrez','FDA awards Class III Premarket Approval (PMA P050017) for Zilver 635 Vascular Stent, Zilver 518 Vascular Stent sponsored by Cook Ireland, Ltd..',0,0,0,14,3,'2026-11-05 18:30:00',NULL,'2026-11-18 02:04:59','2026-11-18 02:04:59','newskrez',NULL,NULL,'en','2026-11-18 08: