(47,'FDA CDRH 510(k) Clearance (K262232): Wound VOX NPWT System (V1-01-01); Wound VOX 300ml Collection Canister & Supply Tubing (CC-00-03); Wound VOX Y-Connector (YK-01-13); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Small (DK-01-01); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Medium (DK-01-02); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Large (DK-01-03','fda-510k-k262232-wound-vox-npwt-system-v1-01-01-wound-vox-300ml-collection-canis-9830aa','FDA issues 510(k) premarket notification clearance for Wound VOX NPWT System (V1-01-01); Wound VOX 300ml Collection Canister & Supply Tubing (CC-00-03); Wound VOX Y-Connector (YK-01-13); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Small (DK-01-01); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Medium (DK-01-02); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Large (DK-01-03); Wound VOX Adhesive Drape (DK-01-04); Wound VOX Foam Dressing (DK-01-05); Wound VOX Suction Bell Assembly (DK-01-06); Wound VOX Wound Contac','\n      <p>The FDA Center for Devices and Radiological Health (CDRH) has finalized premarket notification review under Section 510(k) for <strong>Wound VOX NPWT System (V1-01-01); Wound VOX 300ml Collection Canister & Supply Tubing (CC-00-03); Wound VOX Y-Connector (YK-01-13); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Small (DK-01-01); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Medium (DK-01-02); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Large (DK-01-03); Wound VOX Adhesive Drape (DK-01-04); Wound VOX Foam Dressing (DK-01-05); Wound VOX Suction Bell Assembly (DK-01-06); Wound VOX Wound Contact Layer (10cmx8cm) (DK-01-07); Wound VOX Wound Contact Layer (25cmx17cm) (DK-01-14)</strong>.</p>\n      <h2>Premarket Clearance Dossier</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Submission Number:</strong> K262232</li>\n        <li><strong>Applicant / Sponsor:</strong> Bechtel Medical, Inc.</li>\n        <li><strong>Device Trade Name:</strong> Wound VOX NPWT System (V1-01-01); Wound VOX 300ml Collection Canister & Supply Tubing (CC-00-03); Wound VOX Y-Connector (YK-01-13); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Small (DK-01-01); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Medium (DK-01-02); Wound VOX Dressing Kit Large (DK-01-03); Wound VOX Adhesive Drape (DK-01-04); Wound VOX Foam Dressing (DK-01-05); Wound VOX Suction Bell Assembly (DK-01-06); Wound VOX Wound Contact Layer (10cmx8cm) (DK-01-07); Wound VOX Wound Contact Layer (25cmx17cm) (DK-01-14)</li>\n        <li><strong>Product Code:</strong> OMP</li>\n        <li><strong>Advisory Committee:</strong> General, Plastic Surgery</li>\n        <li><strong>Regulatory Decision:</strong> Substantially Equivalent</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>The FDA determined that the device is substantially equivalent to legally marketed predicate devices for the indications specified in the submission summary.</p>\n    ','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579684385127-1ef15d508118?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80','Medical device engineering and FDA 510(k) clearance documentation.','Published',1,NULL,12,2,'https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpmn/pmn.cfm?ID=K262232','70fe18e0e447c0a47041c061661b10ab457f07aa40cfc4aa625def482703a7cb','K262232','https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpmn/pmn.cfm?ID=K262232','FDA CDRH 510(k) Clearance (K262232): Wound VOX NPW | NewsKrez','FDA issues 510(k) premarket notification clearance for Wound VOX NPWT System (V1-01-01); Wound VOX 300ml Collection Canister & Supply Tubing (CC-00-03); Wound V',0,0,0,22,3,'2026-11-05 18:30:00',NULL,'2026-11-18 02:05:53','2026-11-18 02:05:53','newskrez',NULL,NULL,'en','2026-11-18 08:34:41'),
