(28,'FDA','guidance','FDA Grants Premarket Approval (PMA P960009): Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000) by Medtronic, Inc.','fda-pma-p960009-activa-deep-brain-stimulation-therapy-system-percept-pc-brainsen-64bf5b','FDA awards Class III Premarket Approval (PMA P960009) for Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000) sponsored by Medtronic, Inc..','\n      <p>The FDA Center for Devices and Radiological Health has granted Premarket Approval (PMA) for <strong>Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000)</strong>, classified as a Class III life-supporting or life-sustaining medical device.</p>\n      <h2>PMA Approval Dossier</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>PMA Number:</strong> P960009</li>\n        <li><strong>Applicant:</strong> Medtronic, Inc.</li>\n        <li><strong>Device Designation:</strong> Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000)</li>\n        <li><strong>Product Code:</strong> MHY</li>\n        <li><strong>Decision Code:</strong> APPR</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Approval was based on rigorous review of valid scientific evidence, including bench testing, animal studies, and human clinical trial outcomes establishing a reasonable assurance of safety and effectiveness.</p>\n    ',NULL,'Activa Deep Brain Stimulation Therapy System, Percept PC BrainSense (B32000)','Medtronic, Inc.',NULL,'2026-11-07 18:30:00','https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpma/pma.cfm?id=P960009','P960009','active','2026-11-18 02:04:59','2026-11-18 02:04:59'),
(29,'FDA','guidance','FDA Grants Premarket Approval (PMA P210036): PerClot Absorbable Hemostatic Powder Accessory Tips by Baxter Healthcare Corporation','fda-pma-p210036-perclot-absorbable-hemostatic-powder-accessory-tips-d7e719','FDA awards Class III Premarket Approval (PMA P210036) for PerClot Absorbable Hemostatic Powder Accessory Tips sponsored by Baxter Healthcare Corporation.','\n      <p>The FDA Center for Devices and Radiological Health has granted Premarket Approval (PMA) for <strong>PerClot Absorbable Hemostatic Powder Accessory Tips</strong>, classified as a Class III life-supporting or life-sustaining medical device.</p>\n      <h2>PMA Approval Dossier</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>PMA Number:</strong> P210036</li>\n        <li><strong>Applicant:</strong> Baxter Healthcare Corporation</li>\n        <li><strong>Device Designation:</strong> PerClot Absorbable Hemostatic Powder Accessory Tips</li>\n        <li><strong>Product Code:</strong> LMG</li>\n        <li><strong>Decision Code:</strong> APPR</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Approval was based on rigorous review of valid scientific evidence, including bench testing, animal studies, and human clinical trial outcomes establishing a reasonable assurance of safety and effectiveness.</p>\n    ',NULL,'PerClot Absorbable Hemostatic Powder Accessory Tips','Baxter Healthcare Corporation',NULL,'2026-11-06 18:30:00','https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfpma/pma.cfm?id=P210036','P210036','active','2026-11-18 02:04:59','2026-11-18 02:04:59'),
